  "caveats": [
    "Monthly sampling approximates the 30-day windowing of NIST CSWP 41: windows start on monthly snapshot dates (28-33 days apart), and d0 is the first monthly snapshot that scores the CVE, not its first EPSS date.",
    "LEV here is retrospective: it uses EPSS scores observed after each CVE was published, up to 2026-03-03. It is comparable to the paper's frozen-snapshot setting, not to its historical (point-in-time) EPSS setting.",
    "LEV is a lower bound by construction (the equation is an inequality).",
    "The archive spans two EPSS model versions; scores are multiplied across that boundary.",
    "The frozen EPSS source is the 2026-03-03 feature snapshot; the last LEV window starts at the 2026-03-01 archive file with weight 3/30."
  ],
